          "text": "At approximately __UFO_PROTECTED_000__ hours on the morning of 12 July 2008, several residents of the city of __UFO_PROTECTED_012__ reported observing an unidentified flying object (UFO) in the sky. The object was described as a bright, disk-shaped entity that moved erratically before disappearing suddenly.\n\nEyewitnesses reported that the UFO was first spotted at an altitude of approximately 500 meters (1,640 feet) and then ascended rapidly, reaching an estimated height of 2,000 meters (6,562 feet) before vanishing. The entire incident lasted for approximately 3 minutes.\n\nThe object's unusual behavior and its sudden disappearance left the witnesses puzzled and prompted local authorities to investigate the incident. No official explanation has been provided to date.",
